{
  "id": 42,
  "sort_order": 39,
  "name": "navidrome",
  "category": "entertainment",
  "description": "Navidrome 是一个开源的 Web 音乐流媒体服务器，兼容 Subsonic API，可整理你的本地音乐库，多平台客户端访问。",
  "version": "latest",
  "logo": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/navidrome/navidrome/master/resources/logo-192x192.png",
  "website": "https://github.com/navidrome/navidrome",
  "tutorial": "访问地址：http://服务器IP:4533\n将音乐文件放入挂载的音乐目录（默认只读）。\n内置 SQLite，数据在 ./data。\n首次访问创建管理员账号。\n支持任意 Subsonic 兼容客户端。",
  "dotenv": "",
  "compose": "services:\n  navidrome:\n    image: deluan/navidrome:latest\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    ports:\n      - \"4533:4533\"\n    volumes:\n      - ./data:/data\n      - ./music:/music:ro\n    environment:\n      - ND_SCANSCHEDULE=1h\n      - ND_LOGLEVEL=info\n      - ND_SESSIONTIMEOUT=24h",
